# Rare decay: B0 -> K*0 mu+ mu- (b -> s ll), BTOSLLBALL form-factor model.
# Fully charged final state: K*0 -> K+ pi-. No neutrinos, so the candidate
# peaks in Mbc / deltaE, unlike the semileptonic modes.

Alias      B0sig        B0
Alias      anti-B0sig   anti-B0
ChargeConj B0sig        anti-B0sig

Alias      K*0sig       K*0
Alias      anti-K*0sig  anti-K*0
ChargeConj K*0sig       anti-K*0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000  B0sig anti-B0sig B0 anti-B0   VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
1.000  K*0sig mu+ mu-                PHOTOS BTOSLLBALL;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay K*0sig
1.000  K+ pi-                        VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-K*0sig

End
